  "domain": "artificial-intelligence",
  "definition": "An architectural pattern in which one autonomous agent, equipped with its own model, memory, and tool access, carries an entire task from goal to completion within a single reasoning loop \u2014 with no delegation, inter-agent messaging, or coordination overhead; simpler to build, debug, and evaluate than multi-agent designs, and often the stronger baseline when a capable model with good tools can hold the whole problem in context.",
